---
layout: base.njk
pageType: tags
title: Tags
permalink: /tags/
---
<section class="standard">
  <div class="wrap standard__wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">The Index</p>
    <h1>Tags.</h1>
    <p class="dek">
      An incomplete taxonomy of how, exactly, we got here.
      Click any tag to see every regret it pertains to.
    </p>

    <ul class="tag-cloud">
      {% for tag in collections.tagList %}
        <li>
          <a href="/tags/{{ tag | slugify }}/">
            <span class="tag-cloud__name">{{ tag }}</span>
            <span class="tag-cloud__count mono">{{ collections[tag] | length }}</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>

    <p class="tag-cloud__foot mono">
      {{ collections.tagList | length }} tags across {{ collections.posts | length }} entries.
      Some overlap is to be expected; some overlap is the whole point.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
